{"title":"1998 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At the waterpark, Bonnie and Wendy decided to race each other down a waterslide. Wendy won by 0.25 seconds. If Bonnie’s time was exactly 7.80 seconds, how long did it take for Wendy to go down the slide?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/6/ed6e21ab46cd256952ec22a43b0bb4c02fc59a8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 7.8 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 8.05 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 7.55 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 7.15 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 7.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"428\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Wendy took <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/4288e6251ed4b968095d3cb3180d43d072b1a16c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.8 - 0.25 = 7.55$\" width=\"133\" height=\"12\" /> seconds, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee90f076869827dbb3b46ebe83c1a7399f1182dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-edited by coolmath34\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspa